notes: First slice of the professional DMMW build-out the founder asked for ("alle DMMW Komponenten … von Arrangement über Live Colabo bis zentrierte Meditation"). New Meditation mode (Tools ▸ Meditation) composes Echoel's existing Grade-A bio core into a centered session: pick a duration (5/10/15/20 min) and a breathing pattern (resonance ~6/min default; holds opt-in behind the safety card), breathe with the circle, watch live HRV coherence, a countdown runs, then an end-of-session summary (duration · avg/peak coherence · avg heart rate) and a recent-sessions history. It lights up the previously-dormant SessionRecorder so practice accrues across days. Flash-safe (breath circle ≤0.2 Hz, frozen under Reduce Motion); no audio-thread coupling. Built from tested cores (BreathPacer, BreathPattern, HRVCoherence, SessionRecorder) — low risk. Grounded in a 3-agent DMMW audit: most of the workstation (renderers, AUv3 host, signal router/patchbay, arrangement playback) is already built+wired; the sequenced gaps (Transport unification, visual timeline canvas, audio-clip playback, Ableton Link/Multipeer for Live Colabo) are in scratchpads/PLAN_DMMW_PRO_2026-06-23.md. iOS gate green.
